# Everything under here is either somebody else's file or something a run
# made, so none of it is committed. The TD reports are TD's to publish and the
# media came from a course; sources.json says where each one comes from, and
# 04_push_local_to_blob_cosmosdb.py fetches them into the right folders.
blob/
later/
index/
models/
queue/
# The local console's access log, written by a run
console-access.jsonl
# The one exception: each collection's record, where its policy is written.
# Those are the walkthrough's own rules, so they stay in git; anything else a
# run leaves under cosmosdb/ does not.
cosmosdb/*
!cosmosdb/data_db/
cosmosdb/data_db/*
!cosmosdb/data_db/collection_records/
